      statement: "edge.meta carries two name-similar fields with disjoint scopes and vocabularies: 'construct' (31 edges, values 'websocket_endpoint' 30 + 'event_emit' 1, all type=references) and 'call_construct' (21189 edges, values 'method' 20898 + 'function' 213 + 'cross_file' 78, all type=calls). Zero overlap in populated rows. A schema reader would reasonably believe these were related; they are not."  # 9847
